<title>POLAND: ARIEL TURNS TO PROFIT IN Q1.</title>
<headline>ARIEL TURNS TO PROFIT IN Q1.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ariel preliminary results</p>
<p>for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating loss			   0.36 vs	0.03</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   0.10 vs	0.08 loss</p>
<p>    net profit				 0.07 vs	0.08 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Ariel SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				  2.86 vs	1.19</p>
<p>    costs of sales			   2.37 vs	0.86</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.03 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     5.16 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial costs			  4.70 vs	0.05</p>
<p>    investment				 2.06 vs	0.10</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
